hyprland
hyprlock
hypridle
hyprpaper
hyprpicker
hyprsunset
# Provides hyprland-dialog. Without it Hyprland shows "Your system does not have
# hyprland-guiutils installed" on every login, and — less visibly — logs
# "hyprland-dialog missing from PATH, cannot start ANRManager", so there is no
# dialog offering to kill an application that has stopped responding.
#
# The Debian package to ask for is hyprland-guiutils. hyprland-qtutils is a
# transitional dummy that only depends on it, and the name is now misleading:
# guiutils is built on hyprtoolkit and pulls no Qt at all — 688 kB plus
# libhyprtoolkit5.
hyprland-guiutils
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
uwsm
